WEBVTT

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:08.890
What is that? I heard it yesterday, too.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:23.640
Am I imagining it?

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:44.590
Rh-Rhino?

00:00:44.590 --> 00:00:47.660
What's got you so spooked?

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:50.010
You're more of a wuss than I thought!

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:52.070
I heard this weird sound.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:54.090
Like falling sand...

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:55.240
A weird sound?

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:57.540
No, it's nothing.

00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:00.240
Anyway, I found fuel!

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:01.430
Really?

00:01:01.690 --> 00:01:04.390
Yup! In that hangar.

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:07.080
I've got the fuel truck 
pulled right up alongside.

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:08.390
Hey!

00:01:11.310 --> 00:01:12.520
Wait!

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:31.690
<i>The Sky I Fly with You</i>

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:49.010
Hey, Rhino, we searched pretty 
thoroughly yesterday, right?

00:01:49.010 --> 00:01:51.870
Where did you find this 
fuel and these tools?

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:53.330
Where?

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:56.240
Where... Where, huh?

00:01:56.240 --> 00:01:59.820
Well, stuff like this just works out.

00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:01.720
As long as you focus your mind on it...

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:02.890
What?

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:05.560
What's that supposed to mean?

00:02:05.990 --> 00:02:09.140
"Ask, and it shall be given to you."

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:15.130
What's important is for your 
heart to really want it.

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:18.200
Time, place... Those things don't matter.

00:02:20.710 --> 00:02:22.490
The bullet holes and damage...

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:23.900
You repaired them?

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:26.780
But how?

00:02:26.780 --> 00:02:29.860
This place is really so relaxing.

00:02:29.860 --> 00:02:33.240
Quiet, clean, and no impurities at all.

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:37.830
It makes me wonder why the 
human world is so noisy.

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:42.430
You sound like you'd be 
happier without humanity.

00:02:44.210 --> 00:02:46.440
The Anima are lucky, huh?

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:49.470
They have a nice, simple goal: combat.

00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:51.380
Victory is everything.

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:53.400
Flying is what brings them joy.

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:56.140
In that sense, they're the same.

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:59.740
They're simply driving forward 
to achieve their goal.

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:03.140
What are you...

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:06.290
There's only one difference 
between the Anima and the Xi.

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:07.950
One wants to protect humanity.

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:09.680
One wants to destroy it.

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:14.380
It doesn't look like they actually 
want to destroy humanity.

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:17.300
Wow, you're interesting!

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.600
It's like you're not human!

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.440
So, how about we live here?

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:25.340
You, me, and Gripen!

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:27.390
What about the mission?

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:32.530
The USAF and JSDF think we were shot down.

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:34.570
So let's just stay here!

00:03:34.570 --> 00:03:38.560
Be free! Nobody needs to tie us down.

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:42.030
Are you truly Rhino?

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:43.790
"Truly"?

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:46.080
What's "truth," I wonder?

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:48.120
Who am I?

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:52.290
A piece of a shot-down Xi? A US fighter jet?

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:55.090
Or a program Willy made?

00:03:58.300 --> 00:03:59.980
What is this?

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:05.140
I'm going to get Gripen.

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:06.730
Stay here.

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:08.220
Rhino!

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:13.560
I feel great right now.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:16.320
Once you learn to just get over it,
 you feel a lot better.

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:19.480
That'll be true for you and Gripen, too.

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:21.220
Rhino...

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:25.920
If you shoot at me here, 
you might hit the fuel.

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.230
Do you plan to commit 
suicide with your Daughter?

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:30.400
Don't make me shoot, then.

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:33.370
If you don't, then everything will be fine.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:35.570
This isn't a threat.

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:39.270
I'm not scared of dying at all.

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:43.160
Yup. Smart.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.150
Narutani Kei!

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:58.720
<i>What is that? Ice?</i>

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:00.650
<i>No, glass!</i>

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:03.890
<i>I know this... This light...</i>

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:06.000
<i>No way!</i>

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.380
I have to go.

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:15.140
But go where?

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:29.810
<i>Did the Xi swallow up Rhino?</i>

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:31.120
<i>Is this whole place...</i>

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:41.790
Shit! I can't use the elevator?

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:51.660
Don't run!

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:55.490
If I hit you in the wrong spot, 
it'll just make you suffer!

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:00.400
There!

00:06:00.990 --> 00:06:03.180
Let's talk this out!

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:06.460
I'm sure we can understand each other!

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:18.810
Wait!

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:29.270
It's spread this far?

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:33.840
Gripen...

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:37.620
Please, be safe!

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:45.730
Gripen! Hey, Gripen!

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:46.810
Are you okay?

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:48.600
Gripen, open up!

00:06:48.990 --> 00:06:50.940
Crap... Is there anything I can use?

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:02.100
Gripen!

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:04.410
Gripen!

00:07:04.890 --> 00:07:07.490
Shit! I'll get you out right now!

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:15.830
<i>So quiet... Peaceful...</i>

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:20.150
<i>Like I could forget everything.</i>

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:21.690
Gripen!

00:07:22.390 --> 00:07:23.510
Gripen!

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:25.280
Gripen!

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:38.610
What is this feeling?

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:40.620
Gripen!

00:07:41.070 --> 00:07:42.290
Gripen!

00:07:42.680 --> 00:07:44.030
Gripen!

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:45.310
Gripen!

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:48.980
Kei! To leave behind a future...

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:51.210
That's why I...

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:54.430
Gripen!

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:56.590
Kei?

00:07:56.590 --> 00:07:57.730
Are you okay?

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:02.590
You're still you, right? 
You haven't changed?

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:06.740
Kei, what is this?

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:07.800
We'll talk later!

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:10.320
Let's go! This place is bad news!

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:14.630
Kei, what's going on?

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:16.490
Is this...

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:17.910
I don't know.

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:20.140
But I bet it's got something 
to do with the Xi.

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:23.530
Hey, where are you even going?

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:24.190
Rhino?

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:27.680
I'll be sad if you leave me behind!

00:08:28.210 --> 00:08:29.860
Rhino, where are you?

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:31.350
Forget about her!

00:08:31.350 --> 00:08:32.030
But...

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:35.390
Wait! Don't run away!

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:38.460
We can talk! Understand each other!

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:40.460
Kei, can't you hear her?

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.740
Rhino is telling us to wait.

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:46.300
What happened to Rhino?

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:49.140
She's not...

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:53.190
Hey! Hey!

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:57.330
Let's live here in peace and 
quiet for the rest of our lives!

00:08:57.900 --> 00:08:59.280
Gripen, hurry!

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:00.930
It'll swallow you up, too!

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:03.040
Me, too?

00:09:03.650 --> 00:09:07.350
You've noticed by now, 
haven't you, Narutani Kei?

00:09:07.780 --> 00:09:11.440
So why are you still trying to struggle?

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:15.820
There's no need for the 
Anima and Xi to struggle.

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:18.760
At our root, we're the same thing.

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:20.720
Almost there!

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:22.490
Let's get out of here!

00:09:24.470 --> 00:09:26.020
We're fueled up.

00:09:26.020 --> 00:09:27.760
We can take off from the apron, right?

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:29.010
Y-Yeah.

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:32.540
With our current equipment, 
we only need 300 meters for takeoff.

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:33.700
Okay.

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:36.040
Let's go!

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:49.540
Kei, the airport...

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:51.770
So that was...

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:58.450
The airport's turned into Xi?

00:09:59.210 --> 00:10:00.630
The enemy has taken off.

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:02.320
Multiple missile alerts.

00:10:09.530 --> 00:10:11.080
Saphiro 01.

00:10:14.910 --> 00:10:16.000
Rhino!

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:19.550
<i>You don't have to run, I said!</i>

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:24.210
Fire chaff and flare!

00:10:24.210 --> 00:10:25.100
None remaining.

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:26.730
Shit!

00:10:30.370 --> 00:10:32.220
Are we playing tag again?

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:34.070
This time, I won't lose.

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:37.250
I don't actually want to shoot you.

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:38.630
So let's go back!

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:40.710
Let's go to the airport!

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:46.880
<i>There's no need for us to fight!</i>

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:49.910
We want the same thing.

00:10:49.910 --> 00:10:53.330
The best thing to do is return 
to a state of nature.

00:10:53.810 --> 00:10:58.480
There's no need to cover the world 
in flames and bright lights.

00:10:59.730 --> 00:11:02.930
Just let yourself sink into the 
quiet, peaceful darkness...

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:06.160
<i>There'll be no need to suffer...</i>

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:05.440
What?

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:09.920
Kei, the Anima are meaningless.

00:11:09.920 --> 00:11:12.190
All must be as it should.

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:14.160
We are the same.

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:15.850
Gripen!

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:17.700
Is that what Rhino is saying?

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:19.520
A sad misunderstanding.

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:21.200
The goal is the same.

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.780
Don't listen, Gripen!

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:24.860
Compelling force is needed.

00:11:25.320 --> 00:11:28.530
It is best to return things to what they were.

00:11:28.990 --> 00:11:30.130
No!

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:31.540
That's not right!

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:34.460
This... This old piece of junk...

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:37.000
She was a top secret,

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.970
but always spacing out.

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:40.840
Silly... And a big eater.

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:42.800
And crazy...

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:44.940
Passing out all the time...

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:48.430
And because of that, I had to fly with her.

00:11:48.790 --> 00:11:51.650
But she wanted to be useful to everyone,

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:53.720
to protect humanity!

00:11:53.720 --> 00:11:55.650
Those feelings were real!

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:56.750
That's why I...

00:11:57.710 --> 00:12:01.150
This is JAS-39D-ANM Gripen!

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:02.400
My partner!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:10.360
Rhino, I'm sorry.

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:12.040
I can't go.

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:16.620
Gripen...

00:12:16.990 --> 00:12:18.720
As I said before...

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:21.680
I was born to fly with you, Kei.

00:12:21.680 --> 00:12:26.630
Keeping you alive to see the 
fate of this world is my job.

00:12:27.880 --> 00:12:30.200
Because I am your wings.

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:32.940
Kei, give me your orders!

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:33.980
Okay!

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:35.360
We're heading back to Komatsu!

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:38.970
Tear a path through the 
enemies and head back home!

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:39.910
Roger!

00:12:55.240 --> 00:12:56.680
She's fast!

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:59.670
But if we turn our potential 
energy into speed...

00:13:01.430 --> 00:13:03.780
Can you target a missile?

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:06.610
Not easily at this distance.

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:10.050
We need to get closer!

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:12.440
Closer... to Rhino?

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:14.660
<i>No.</i>

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:16.660
<i>She's on our six.</i>

00:13:16.660 --> 00:13:18.900
<i>If I get close, she'll take us down first!</i>

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:22.800
<i>She's not going to let 
us get in firing range!</i>

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:25.810
<i>Is there any way to get in firing 
range without getting closer?</i>

00:13:25.810 --> 00:13:26.880
<i>No...</i>

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:30.630
How many missiles do we have left?

00:13:30.630 --> 00:13:33.170
Two. And then machine guns.

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.790
Okay! Let's use them all!

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:43.700
Kei, if we keep climbing, 
Rhino will catch up with us!

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:46.490
Kei, she's getting a lock!

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:48.220
Kei!

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:51.450
Release Missile 1!

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:52.730
Bring it down in front of her!

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:53.930
Roger!

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:04.750
Lock on!

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:06.200
Fox 2!

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:08.360
Go!

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:19.610
We got her?

00:14:23.370 --> 00:14:24.460
Rhino...

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:31.410
The ones from the airport?

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:34.920
They caught up with us while 
we were fighting Rhino?

00:14:35.510 --> 00:14:37.020
Gripen, get ready to fight them!

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:38.910
No good! We are Winchester!

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:40.350
Shit!

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:48.110
Shit!

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:53.820
Ta-dah!

00:14:53.820 --> 00:14:56.610
Sheesh... Where have you been?

00:14:56.610 --> 00:14:58.030
We've been looking for you.

00:14:58.030 --> 00:15:00.630
I didn't expect to find you in 
the middle of a fun dogfight.

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:01.920
Eagle!

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:03.210
Phantom!

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:05.570
You vanished off radar for three hours.

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:09.330
I assumed you'd long run 
out of fuel and crashed.

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:12.060
What kind of magic spell did you use?

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:13.520
Three hours?

00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:16.630
H-Hey, what's today's date?

00:15:16.630 --> 00:15:21.200
What? Have you even 
forgotten what day it is?

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:22.810
<i>Just tell me.</i>

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:26.660
August 12th. Saturday.

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:29.640
The Brawlers went out of control 
and the operation was canceled.

00:15:29.640 --> 00:15:32.500
But the battle continues.

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:37.190
<i>We just got resupplied at 
Naha Base and came back.</i>

00:15:38.280 --> 00:15:41.790
Hey, stop talking already!

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:43.410
Let's get 'em!

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:44.400
It's okay, right?

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:47.420
We've succeeded in our goal of 
finding Kei-san and Gripen.

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:50.030
There's no point in further combat.

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:54.450
But I'm not the sort of girl who'll 
let someone hurt my comrades

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:57.250
and get away with it, so...

00:15:57.250 --> 00:16:00.280
Let's do some damage.

00:16:04.220 --> 00:16:05.670
No fair!

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:06.720
I'm going, too!

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:17.640
Viper Zero!

00:16:18.050 --> 00:16:19.070
Everyone...

00:16:19.550 --> 00:16:22.260
Let me get some, too!

00:16:46.800 --> 00:16:49.030
The enemy is beginning to withdraw.

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:52.170
We're saved?

00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:58.350
Gripen, can you take over for a second?

00:16:58.350 --> 00:16:59.780
Sure.

00:17:00.150 --> 00:17:02.630
Sorry. I need to rest.

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:05.010
You have control.

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:06.980
I have control.

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:20.720
<b>JSDF Naha Hospital</b>

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:24.390
I never thought I'd see anybody make direct
contact with them and make it back alive.

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:26.170
I...

00:17:27.260 --> 00:17:30.080
I believe what you said.

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:32.390
The Xi and Anima are different.

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:34.800
They may be made from the same parts,

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:36.890
but they're completely different.

00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:39.610
And that's not true?

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:41.060
I don't know.

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:44.550
An Anima tried to kill me,

00:17:44.550 --> 00:17:46.500
but an Anima tried to save me, too.

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:48.600
But...

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:54.960
This is a hospital.

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:56.750
Don't be like that.

00:17:57.500 --> 00:18:00.630
They wouldn't let me smoke 
on the whole plane ride.

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:04.200
I took a look at Rhino's source code.

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:09.520
The USAF had put heavy restrictions on the way
 she could think and the things she could do.

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:14.380
They put safeguards everywhere to keep her 
from doing things they couldn't predict.

00:18:14.890 --> 00:18:17.820
They treated her as a tool, nothing more.

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:21.580
She didn't seem like that at all.

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:24.800
She was outspoken, curious...

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:27.830
But sometimes she could be kind.

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:32.210
And that's probably the 
only way they let her be.

00:18:33.180 --> 00:18:36.040
As for what kind of Anima she was...

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:38.240
Well, there's no way to know now.

00:18:38.530 --> 00:18:42.250
She may not have known herself.

00:18:42.730 --> 00:18:47.600
So when all those bonds were removed, 
she quickly lost sight of herself.

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:55.580
Well, the Japanese Anima have safeties, too.

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:57.220
It's just a question of degree.

00:18:57.220 --> 00:19:02.020
When those safeties are removed, 
there's no telling what will happen at all.

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:03.790
How do we deal with that?

00:19:04.190 --> 00:19:07.170
Make them like humanity. 
That's the only way.

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:10.970
Make us so important to them 
that they want to protect us.

00:19:10.970 --> 00:19:11.990
That's all.

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:14.410
It's unscientific.

00:19:14.410 --> 00:19:17.040
I'd prefer to be called a romanticist.

00:19:18.020 --> 00:19:20.230
It's time for me to go.

00:19:20.740 --> 00:19:23.640
Tell me the details later.

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:25.820
Yashirodoori-san...

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:31.280
We can co-exist with the Anima, right?

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:34.510
We can live alongside each other, right?

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:39.060
Have some confidence, Narutani Kei.

00:19:39.060 --> 00:19:41.580
You and Gripen gave us hope.

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:44.700
No matter how bad things look,

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:47.580
she showed us there's one 
bond that will never break.

00:19:53.770 --> 00:19:54.700
Kei...

00:19:56.270 --> 00:19:57.240
What is it?

00:19:57.240 --> 00:19:58.650
Did something happen?

00:19:58.650 --> 00:20:01.590
No, nothing.

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:05.090
I just wanted to be with you.

00:20:06.230 --> 00:20:09.190
Do you believe in fate?

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:12.730
It's just a feeling I had,

00:20:13.240 --> 00:20:15.260
but we met on the East China Sea,

00:20:15.260 --> 00:20:17.200
then again at Komatsu.

00:20:17.550 --> 00:20:20.740
Then we learned that we couldn't 
fly unless we were together.

00:20:21.410 --> 00:20:23.940
It's almost funny how many 
coincidences there were.

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:26.650
But it doesn't feel strange at all, does it?

00:20:27.230 --> 00:20:30.400
It feels natural to have you by my side.

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:34.060
I thought about what you might call that...

00:20:34.440 --> 00:20:37.240
And the word "fate" came to mind.

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:39.160
What about you?

00:20:40.770 --> 00:20:42.530
I don't really know,

00:20:42.530 --> 00:20:45.350
but I don't think I believe in fate.

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:49.320
If it was fate that brought us together,

00:20:49.320 --> 00:20:53.600
then that means I couldn't have 
found you if fate got in my way.

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:55.680
That's hard to accept.

00:20:59.140 --> 00:21:00.490
I see!

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:05.360
So it's our will and our choices 
that brought us here, huh?

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:10.520
<i>We lost many lives in that battle.</i>

00:21:10.520 --> 00:21:11.900
<i>We lost Rhino.</i>

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:14.830
<i>Humanity gained nothing at all.</i>

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:19.560
<i>We just realized again 
how strange our enemy is.</i>

00:21:20.650 --> 00:21:25.290
<i>I still don't know why the Xi fight.</i>

00:21:25.850 --> 00:21:27.570
<i>To rule the world?</i>

00:21:27.570 --> 00:21:29.220
<i>Wipe out humanity?</i>

00:21:29.590 --> 00:21:31.340
<i>Secure a place for themselves to live?</i>

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:34.580
<i>I still don't know what 
the Anima are, either.</i>

00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:37.790
<i>But if I don't defeat the Xi,</i>

00:21:37.790 --> 00:21:40.130
<i>I can't see the future 
that waits beyond them.</i>

00:21:40.990 --> 00:21:42.940
<i>The Anima and the Daughters are 
tools to make that happen.</i>

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:45.150
<i>And for now, that's enough.</i>

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:48.110
<i>If it's not fate, then...</i>

00:21:49.090 --> 00:21:50.840
<i>Our meeting was...</i>

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:58.240
Someday, I want to fly in the 
skies over China with you.

00:22:01.510 --> 00:22:02.460
Yeah.
